IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ORDACK.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-STATUS          PIC X(2).
01  WS-ACK-CODE        PIC X(2).
01  WS-REASON          PIC X(20).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
BUILD-ACK.
    ACCEPT WS-STATUS

    EVALUATE WS-STATUS
        WHEN "OK"
            MOVE "IA" TO WS-ACK-CODE
        WHEN "BO"
            MOVE "IB" TO WS-ACK-CODE
        WHEN "RJ"
            MOVE "IR" TO WS-ACK-CODE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "IR" TO WS-ACK-CODE
            MOVE "SYSTEM ERROR" TO WS-REASON
    END-EVALUATE

    DISPLAY WS-ACK-CODE
    STOP RUN.
